strings.IBR_AP_victory_category_desc:
With a victory in the polls, the £IBR_party_AP AP will now govern the Union until a constitution is written and approven by the Iberian people. £IBR_party_AP Alianza Popular is made up of several parties and while they are all conservatives, each party's committment to democracy is different. As such the government will have to either balance the factions or give into one of the sides, which will determine the form of the coalition in the next elections.

While there is no risk of the government collapsing, it is still important to keep the faith of the Iberian people in the constitutional process, as their faith will determine the fate of the constitution.

{ibr_ap_victory_get_leaning}
{ibr_get_transition_process_belief}

